These binaries derive from TWO MIT-licensed sources, and MIT requires the
copyright notice of each to travel with every copy. They are both below.

The executables are a stripped build of Microsoft's ApplicationLoopback /
ProcessList sample from Windows-classic-samples, obtained through the
application-loopback npm package. Until 2026-07-31 only the package author's
notice was here; Microsoft's was missing, and electron-builder ships these
files inside every Demli installer, so each release was distributing them
without it. See README.md in this directory for what was stripped and why.

